# Agent router

Read **`AGENTS.md`** for commands, layout, CI, and Sentry — not the whole README unless needed.

| Topic | Where |
|-------|--------|
| Python style | `.cursor/rules/python-conventions.mdc` |
| Local dev | `just sync`, `just test`, `just lint` (or `uv` equivalents) |
| Docker / Lambda image | `just build-image`, `just push-image`, `just update-lambda` |
| CI deploy | `.github/workflows/` + `terraform/ci/README.md` |
